{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53763","headline":"雨歇池上 · 白居易","name":"雨歇池上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"檐前微雨歇，池上凉风起。\n桥竹碧鲜鲜，岸移莎靡靡。\n苍然古苔石，清浅平流水。\n何言中门前，便是深山里。\n双僮侍坐卧。\n一杖扶行止。\n饥闻麻粥香，渴觉云汤美。\n平生所好物，今日多在此。\n此外更何思？\n市朝心已矣！（见前书卷六三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}